# What SpamAssassin's own guess is worth. Its defaults are careful, made for servers whose Bayes may be poorly
# taught: BAYES_50 counts 0.8 and BAYES_99 3.5, so even "almost certainly spam" needs another rule to reach the
# 5 points that mark a message. Here everybody's Junk folder teaches it every night, so its guess is worth more
# than that: a message it puts at 99% is spam on that alone, and one at 50% is halfway there.
#
# None of this counts until Bayes has seen 200 spam and 200 good messages; before that SpamAssassin leaves these
# rules out altogether.
score BAYES_00              -1.9
score BAYES_05              -0.5
score BAYES_20              -0.001
score BAYES_40              -0.001
score BAYES_50              3.5
score BAYES_60              4.0
score BAYES_80              4.5
score BAYES_95              5.0
score BAYES_99              6.0
score BAYES_999             1.0
